  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksTitle": "AWA Together inoshanda sei?",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksDescription": "Dzidza kuti app iyi inokubvumira sei kutsigira mumwe wako uchiremekedza zvaanoita.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph1": "AWA Pamwe chete unokwanisa kuona mashoko akasarudzwa nemumwe wako kuti akupe.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph2": "Somuenzaniso, ungaona mashoko pamusoro penguva yake, nguva yake inotevera, kana kuti hwindo rake rinobereka apo kugoverana kunovhurira.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph3": "Mashoko anooneka anogara achitsamira pane zvaanosarudza.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoTitle": "Nei mashoko acho achiri kuvanzwa?",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoDescription": "Mumwe wako anosarudza zvaanenge achigovana newe.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph1": "Mumwe wako ndiye anoona kuti mashoko aanoda kukuudza ndeechake.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph2": "Kana mashoko asina kuoneka munzvimbo yako, zvinogona kungoreva kuti haana kusarudza kuagovana.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph3": "AWA Together inongokuratidza mashoko aunenge wava kukwanisa kuwana.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingTitle": "Kunzwisisa mashoko akagoverwa",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingDescription": "Tsanangudzo dzakareruka dzegore rokutenderera, nguva yazvino, hwindo rokubereka, ovulation inofungidzirwa, uye nguva inotevera.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingIntro": "Hezvino izvo mashoko akagoverwa nemi anogona kureva:",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCycleDay": "Zuva rechitenderera",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCycleDay": "Rinoratidza mazuva kubvira pakatanga nguva yake yokupedzisira.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCurrentPhase": "Chikamu chinoitika",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCurrentPhase": "Inoratidza danho razvino remutambo kana riine.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termFertileWindow": "Hwindo rinobereka",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionFertileWindow": "Nguva inofungidzirwa apo mukana wekubereka mwana unogona kunge wakakwirira.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termOvulation": "Kufungidzirwa kwekuvhara",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionOvulation": "Kufungidzira nguva apo ovulation inoitika, zvichibva pane ruzivo rwuripo.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termNextPeriod": "Kufungidzirwa kwemwedzi inotevera",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionNextPeriod": "Zuva rinotarisirwa rokutanga kwomwedzi wake unotevera.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termPeriodStatus": "Mamiriro ezvinhu emwaka",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionPeriodStatus": "Inoratidza kuti nguva yake yava kupera here kana kuti iri kuenderera mberi.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingTitle": "Ndiri kuva dambudziko pamwe AWA",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingDescription": "Chii chaunofanira kuita kana mashoko asiri kuoneka, kubatana kuchiita sekunge kwakamiswa, kana kuti une imwe nyaya.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph1": "Kana mashoko asina kuratidzwa, tanga nekuongorora kuti kubatana kwako neIndaneti kuri kushanda zvakanaka.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph2": "Dzimwe mashoko anogona kunge achishayikwa nokuti mumwe wako haasi kuagovana.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph3": "Unogonawo kuedza kuvhara uye kuvhurazve app yacho.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph4": "Kana dambudziko racho rikaramba riripo, unogona kutaura neAWA.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportTitle": "Tsigiro yekutaurirana",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportDescription": "Chikwata chedu chiri pano kuti chibatsire.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportParagraph1": "Kana uine mubvunzo, kusangana nedambudziko, kana kuti uchida kutipa mhinduro, unogona kutaura neboka reAWA kubva muchikamu chino.",
